From: J. R. Okajima <hooanon05g@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] aufs: refresh to upstream aufs6.18

Forward the carried aufs to the current upstream aufs-standalone aufs6.18
snapshot (f8b3fda5): accumulated bugfixes plus x86 CONFIG_PREEMPT_RT
support. Generated as a delta from our carried aufs to upstream, preserving
our integration.

